From fe80c6679cfa81763ba35540e6373d100d0af97d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ilies CHERGUI <ichergui@nvidia.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 16:43:34 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] samples: honour CMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES

Each CUDA sample hard-codes its target's CUDA_ARCHITECTURES to 75 (or
50 before CUDA 13), overriding whatever the build selected. Only set
those defaults when CMAKE_CUDA_ARCHITECTURES is not defined, so the
samples are built for the target GPU.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [OE-specific]
Signed-off-by: Ilies CHERGUI <ichergui@nvidia.com>
---
 .../13.0.37/Samples/AppDecode/AppDecD3D/CMakeLists.txt        | 4 +++-
 .../13.0.37/Samples/AppDecode/AppDecGL/CMakeLists.txt         | 4 +++-
 .../Samples/AppDecode/AppDecImageProvider/CMakeLists.txt      | 4 +++-
 .../13.0.37/Samples/AppDecode/AppDecLowLatency/CMakeLists.txt | 4 +++-
